n-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0ecba33\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24b6d34 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"24b6d34\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">1. Lesson - Introduction to Product Feeds\n<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-969f737 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"969f737\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Objective:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Build a foundational understanding of how product data connects your store to ad platforms and marketplaces.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-458831e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"458831e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad28b0f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ad28b0f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>You\u2019ll learn:<\/b><\/p><ol><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/#definition\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What a product feed actually is<\/span><\/a><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/#how\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How feeds act as the language between your store and ad platforms.<\/span><\/a><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/#why\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why feeds matter more today (AI-driven ad systems like PMax rely on feed quality).<\/span><\/a><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/#optimized\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The difference between connected vs optimized feeds.\u00a0<\/span><\/a><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/#standards\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Common feed formats and standards (Google, Microsoft, Meta, Amazon).<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da7c6a6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"da7c6a6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8874a9f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"8874a9f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/what-is-a-product-data-feed-ecommerce-shopping-ad-1024x576.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5681\" alt=\"Example of a Product Data Feed or ecommerce showing product images, titles, descriptions, and prices used in Google Shopping, Meta ads, and online marketplaces - FeedOps Learning\u200b\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/what-is-a-product-data-feed-ecommerce-shopping-ad-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/what-is-a-product-data-feed-ecommerce-shopping-ad-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/up