tton-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Take the Quiz<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42930c9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"42930c9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-846722d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"846722d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4ff56f1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4ff56f1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2. How Feeds Power eCommerce AI Advertising\n<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0e58f78 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0e58f78\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Objective:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Understand how product feeds fuel machine learning and targeting in ad platforms.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-485a481 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"485a481\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0610988 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0610988\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>You\u2019ll learn:<\/b><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/c1-l2-how-feeds-power-ai-in-ecommerce-ads\/#definition\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How AI learns from product attributes like title, price, color, and type.<\/span><\/a><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/c1-l2-how-feeds-power-ai-in-ecommerce-ads\/#data-completeness\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why data completeness and accuracy improve targeting.<\/span><\/a><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/c1-l2-how-feeds-power-ai-in-ecommerce-ads\/#poor-feed\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How poor feeds waste ad spend (AI misfires).<\/span><\/a><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/c1-l2-how-feeds-power-ai-in-ecommerce-ads\/#goal-aligns\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How FeedOps aligns feeds with campaign goals like sales vs discovery.\u00a0<\/span><\/a><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/c1-l2-how-feeds-power-ai-in-ecommerce-ads\/#simple-title\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Example: How changing a product title impacts Performance Max results.\u00a0<\/span><\/a><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/c1-l2-how-feeds-power-ai-in-ecommerce-ads\/#website-data\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why Strong Website Data Drives Better Ads and Search Results<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d14a7d3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d14a7d3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b02906c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id